### Create user

POST http://localhost:7070/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newUser",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}


### Login with user

POST http://localhost:7070/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newUser",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}


